### Ping endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/ping

###

### Get all diary entries (non-sensitive)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/diaries

###

### Get a specific diary entry by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/diaries/1

###

### Get a non-existent diary entry (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/diaries/999

###

### Create a new diary entry - Valid data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "2025-07-11",
    "weather": "sunny",
    "visibility": "great",
    "comment": "Beautiful day for flying, perfect visibility and calm winds"
}

###

### Create a new diary entry - Another valid entry
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "2025-07-10",
    "weather": "rainy",
    "visibility": "poor",
    "comment": "Challenging flight conditions, had to be extra careful"
}

###

### Create diary entry - Invalid weather (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "2025-07-11",
    "weather": "snowy",
    "visibility": "good",
    "comment": "Invalid weather type"
}

###

### Create diary entry - Invalid visibility (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "2025-07-11",
    "weather": "sunny",
    "visibility": "excellent",
    "comment": "Invalid visibility type"
}

###

### Create diary entry - Missing optional comment (should succeed)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "2025-07-11",
    "weather": "sunny",
    "visibility": "good"
}

###

### Create diary entry - Invalid date format (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "invalid-date",
    "weather": "sunny",
    "visibility": "good",
    "comment": "Invalid date format"
}

###

### Create diary entry - Missing fields (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "weather": "sunny",
    "comment": "Missing date and visibility"
}
